Rollback: Agent

Purpose:
  Defines rollback and recovery policies for agent actions.

Checkpoint:
  Agent MUST create checkpoint before risky actions.

  Types:
    Git diff:
      Normal code changes
    Checkpoint:
      Risky migrations, large refactors

RollbackFlow:
  RUN
    ↓
  CHECKPOINT
    ↓
  ACTION
    ↓
  VERIFY

  If fail:
    ROLLBACK CHECKPOINT

PartialFailure:
  Agent MUST preserve real state, not mark entire task as FAILED.

Recovery:
  Transient failures:
    Retry
  Permanent failures:
    Create new task
  Human-required:
    Stop for approval

RollbackRules:
  [RB1]  Agent MUST create checkpoint before risky actions.
  [RB2]  Agent MUST preserve partial success state.
  [RB3]  Agent MUST not mark entire task as FAILED when only part failed.
  [RB4]  Agent MUST recover from transient failures automatically.

State: +